      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782308310853,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Staff-level notes\n1. Separate write correctness from read latency.\n2. Use versioned immutable snapshots for auditability.\n3. Redis TTL handles missed events; CDC/outbox drives freshness.\n4. SDK cache is resilience boundary when service is down.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2e1da26f090d4587b3d2",
      "originalText": "Staff-level notes\n1. Separate write correctness from read latency.\n2. Use versioned immutable snapshots for auditability.\n3. Redis TTL handles missed events; CDC/outbox drives freshness.\n4. SDK cache is resilience boundary when service is down.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b07"
    },
